    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40347" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rādīcŭla</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		dim.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>a small root</i>, <i>rootlet</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 2, 66, 136</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 5, 5,
			5</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>Fuller</i>'<i>sweed</i>, <i>soapwort</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 19, 3,
				18, § 48</span></i>. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A small kind of radish</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 4, 8,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 2,
			19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 2, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">29 al.</span></i></div>
